event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_009442f58f47fa5e006a92c41eee1887d09aa2ee0207509eae","output_index":0,"sequence_number":95,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Explaining multiplication steps**\n\nThe user wants to see the steps for multiplying 17 by 23. I think I could show them the distributive method: 23 times 17 equals 23 times (10 plus 7), which gives me 230 plus 161, totaling 391. Alternatively, using long multiplication: 17 times 3 is 51 (write 1 and carry 5), and then 17 times 2 is 34, shifting it gives me 340. Adding 51 and 340 results in 391, which is my final answer!"}

